	<!-- Up a level: the folder above. -->
	<!-- What is done to the folder shown, beside what is done to items on the same line: the folder with a
	     small bin, and with an arrow out of it, at its top right - a bin and Move to folder would be there twice.
	     A bin, not a cross: the cross closes, the bin deletes (one meaning each). -->
	<StreamGeometry x:Key="[Glyph] Delete folder">M 5,4 L 4.6,4 L 3.6,2.5 L 1,2.5 L 1,10.5 L 10.5,10.5 L 10.5,7.3  M 7.3,1.9 L 11.3,1.9  M 8.6,1.9 L 8.6,1 L 10,1 L 10,1.9  M 7.8,1.9 L 8.2,5.4 L 10.4,5.4 L 10.8,1.9</StreamGeometry>
	<StreamGeometry x:Key="[Glyph] Move folder">M 5,4 L 4.6,4 L 3.6,2.5 L 1,2.5 L 1,10.5 L 10.5,10.5 L 10.5,7.3  M 7.2,2.75 L 11.2,2.75  M 9.6,1.15 L 11.2,2.75 L 9.6,4.35</StreamGeometry>
	<!-- A page's panes, each a frame with the pane marked off: the folder tree at the left, the strip of
