	<StreamGeometry x:Key="[Glyph] Compare">M 1.5,1.5 L 4.5,1.5 L 4.5,10.5 L 1.5,10.5 Z  M 7.5,1.5 L 10.5,1.5 L 10.5,10.5 L 7.5,10.5 Z  M 5.2,4.5 L 6.8,4.5  M 5.2,7.5 L 6.8,7.5</StreamGeometry>

